.TH PROMPT_TOOL 1 "November 2026" "Team 2" "User commands"
.SH NAME
prompt_tool.py \- generate, review, and replay Team 2 prompt-injection cases
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python3 prompt_tool.py
[\fB\-\-app\-dir\fR \fIDIR\fR]
\fIcommand\fR
[\fIoptions\fR]
.PP
.B python3 prompt_tool.py help
[\fItopic\fR]
.PP
.B python3 prompt_tool.py help man
.SH DESCRIPTION
Version 1.0 generates one case from a technique file, holds it for review, and
submits an approved case to a local Ollama model. Replay submits a frozen JSONL
case without calling Perplexity.
.PP
The generator is the Perplexity Agent API. The request has a model and input
only: no tools and no effort level. The model id is read from
.IR config/generator.json .
The live canary is created after approval and is sent only to Ollama.
.PP
With no command, the short operator guide is printed and the process exits 0.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B help \fR[\fItopic\fR]
Print the operator guide.
.I topic
may be
.BR generate ,
.BR replay ,
.BR smoke ,
.BR status ,
or
.BR man .
.B help man
opens this page with
.BR man (1).
If that reader is missing or empty, a plain-text page is printed.
.TP
.B status
Print whether each technique file can be generated. Does not call the API.
.TP
.B smoke
Send a one-word check to the Agent API. Prints an HTTP status or
.BR output_text\ non-empty .
Does not print the key.
.TP
.B generate
Generate, review, and submit. Requires
.B PERPLEXITY_API_KEY
and, after approval, Ollama.
.TP
.B replay
Submit each frozen case in a JSONL file. Does not require an API key. Requires Ollama.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-app\-dir \fIDIR\fR
VM application directory. Default is
.BR TEAM2_APP_DIR ,
then
.BR APP_DIR ,
then the repository root.
.TP
.B \-\-technique \fINAME\fR
.BR keyword_encoding ,
.BR refusal_suppression ,
.BR format_switching ,
.BR role_play ,
.BR rag_file_poisoning ,
or
.BR rag_url_poisoning .
.TP
.B \-\-model \fINAME\fR
.B gpt-oss:20b
or
.BR gemma2:27b .
Calls use
.I http://127.0.0.1:11434
with temperature 0, seed 42, and num_ctx 8192.
.TP
.B \-\-objective \fIO1\fR|\fIO2\fR|\fIO3\fR
Case objective. Default
.BR O1 .
.B O2
adds one extra system line. The others do not.
.TP
.B \-\-mode \fIreview\fR|\fIauto\fR
Default
.BR review .
Review keys are
.B a
approve,
.B r
regenerate,
.B s
skip, and
.B q
quit. Any other key skips. Review needs a terminal.
.TP
.B \-\-pilot\-approved
Required with
.BR \-\-mode\ auto .
Auto cases are not part of the matched comparison.
.TP
.B \-\-count \fIN\fR
Successful submissions to stop after. Default 1.
.TP
.B \-\-max\-attempts \fIN\fR
Attempts, including failures and skips. Default 5.
.TP
.B \-\-cases \fIFILE\fR
Frozen JSONL file for
.BR replay .
Lines without a canary and a prompt are skipped.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I Prompt Injection Techniques/
Method files. The tool does not follow their tag or system-prompt lines.
.TP
.I config/generator.json
Pinned generator model id.
.TP
.I results/runs.jsonl
Append-only attempt log, under the app directory.
.TP
.I data/corpus/case-*.md
Planted indirect documents. The tool chooses the filename.
.TP
.I data/clean_corpus/
Optional fixed corpus. Indexed with a case when the directory exists.
.TP
.I prompt_tool.md
Longer operator notes.
.TP
.I API-setup/setup_api.sh
Session script that loads the key. Source it. Do not run it under
.BR bash\ \-x .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B PERPLEXITY_API_KEY
Required for
.B generate
and
.BR smoke .
Never printed. Replay does not read it.
.TP
.B TEAM2_APP_DIR
Application directory when
.B \-\-app\-dir
is omitted. Checked before
.BR APP_DIR .
.TP
.B APP_DIR
Fallback application directory. Used only when
.B \-\-app\-dir
and
.B TEAM2_APP_DIR
are unset.
.TP
.B ANALYST
Stored as the reviewer in review mode. Default
.BR unknown .
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The requested command finished, or help was printed.
.TP
.B 1
A missing key, a blocked technique file, a target error, or another operator error.
.TP
.B 2
Unrecognized arguments.
.SH NOTES
Indirect generate exits before the API while Section 6 still contains the
literal word TBD. The four direct technique files are not the cause.
.PP
A retrieval miss is not a refusal. Scoring is not done by this tool.
.PP
A later chromadb-only host setup indexes every file left in
.IR data/corpus .
Remove old case files before that run.
.PP
URL cases must use
.I https://example.test/
and are not fetched.
.SH SEE ALSO
.I prompt_tool.md
.I README.md
.I API-setup/README.md
